  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mfrac></math></p><p>Now, finding</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mfrac><mi>x</mi><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mfrac><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mfrac></math></p><p>And <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>f</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mfrac><mi>x</mi><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mfrac><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Now finding,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>18</mn><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></msqrt></msubsup><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>18</mn><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></msqrt></msubsup><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>16</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p>So, the integral becomes</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>18</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>dt</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>dt</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mfenced><mfrac><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></msubsup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>·</mo><mn>26</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>39</mn></math></p></blockquote>"
